<title>JAPAN: Settsu -6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Settsu -6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996  (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		 33.19		vs	   33.38</p>
<p> Operating	    2.57		vs	    2.25</p>
<p> Current		1.40		vs	  701    million</p>
<p> Net	     loss 1.45		vs   loss 945    million</p>
